{"id":32648,"date":"2025-08-27T13:40:59","date_gmt":"2025-08-27T13:40:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/un-demands-justice-over-israeli-double-strike-on-gaza-hospital-bbc-news\/"},"modified":"2025-08-27T13:40:59","modified_gmt":"2025-08-27T13:40:59","slug":"un-demands-justice-over-israeli-double-strike-on-gaza-hospital-bbc-news","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/un-demands-justice-over-israeli-double-strike-on-gaza-hospital-bbc-news\/","title":{"rendered":"UN demands justice over Israeli double strike on Gaza hospital  | BBC News"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The UN has said &#8220;there needs to be justice&#8221; following Israel&#8217;s double strike on a Gaza hospital which killed at <!--more--> least 20 people, as an initial Israeli military probe said the strike had targeted a &#8220;camera positioned by Hamas&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>The Israeli attack on Nasser hospital in Khan Younis on Monday saw an initial strike kill at least one person, a Reuters cameraman who was operating a live TV feed from a staircase on the side of the hospital building. A second strike in the same location about 10 minutes later hit journalists and rescuers who were attending the scene.<\/p>\n<p>Condemnation of the attack, whose victims included five journalists and four health workers, has been mounting, with UK Prime Minister Keir Starmer describing it as &#8220;completely indefensible&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>On Tuesday, the Israel Defense Forces (IDF) released its initial inquiry, which identified several &#8220;gaps&#8221; for further investigation.<\/p>\n<p>In its statement, the IDF said it identified a camera positioned by Hamas in the area of the hospital &#8220;used to observe the activity of IDF troops&#8221;, without providing evidence.<\/p>\n<p>&#8220;The troops operated to remove the threat by striking and dismantling the camera,&#8221; the statement said. It alleged that six of those killed were &#8220;terrorists&#8221;. A military spokesperson later said that journalists working for Reuters and the Associated Press had not been a target.<\/p>\n<p>The IDF report appears to be a shift in tone from Prime Minister Netanyahu&#8217;s statement on Monday evening, which characterised the incident as a &#8220;tragic mishap&#8221;.<\/p>\n<p>Subscribe here: <a href=\"http:\/\/bit.ly\/1rbfUog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http:\/\/bit.ly\/1rbfUog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>For more news, analysis and features visit: www.bbc.com\/news<\/p>\n<p>#Gaza #BBCNews<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The UN has said &#8220;there needs to be justice&#8221; following Israel&#8217;s double strike on a Gaza hospital which killed at<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":32668,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_exactmetrics_skip_tracking":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_active":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_note":"","_exactmetrics_sitenote_category":0,"footnotes":""},"categories":[3],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-32648","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-world"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/32648","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=32648"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/32648\/revisions"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/32668"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=32648"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","